# Git cannot track an empty directory, and structures/README.md tells authors to
# export their .mcstructure files into exactly this path. Without this file the
# path does not exist in a fresh clone and step 3 of that guide points nowhere.
#
# The namespace matters: Bedrock derives a structure's id from the first folder
# under structures/, so a file saved here is "gv:buildings/<name>" - which is
# what BUILDING_MANIFEST records expect. Delete this once real structures land.
